%h2.mt-4 Badges

%p.text-muted
  Bootstrap badges using soft/subtle colors.
  Class names follow the BS4 convention (.badge-*) aliased from BS5 .text-bg-* with lighter backgrounds.

.d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-3.align-items-start.mb-3
  - %w[primary secondary success danger warning info light dark].each do |color|
    .d-flex.flex-column.align-items-center.gap-1
      %span.badge{ class: "badge-#{color}" }= color.capitalize
      %code.small .badge-#{color}

%h3.mt-4 In context

%p
  Badges are used inline with text, e.g. status indicators:
  %span.badge.badge-success Active
  %span.badge.badge-warning Awaiting Approval
  %span.badge.badge-danger Return / Changes Requested
  %span.badge.badge-info Info
  %span.badge.badge-primary Primary
  %span.badge.badge-secondary Secondary
